{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/puvCoLthqX4-ouhPZVYi-g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:47.154775+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/puvCoLthqX4-ouhPZVYi-g","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRiaibeac7jUqlnWoUPBIkNt3ia8n3fBvNe8ArxHDDIvhLkNIrAflUC1BedJPkjhJRibt61NtsABMZpHw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学院概况</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJRiaibeac7jUqlnWoUPBIkNt3taNOG21OskWdAsezsicMxsG0aEAtAOU0zk5qLqGtP9Yu1dOQElhkh0A/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>南京理工大学外国语学院，前身为中国人民解放军军事工程学院炮兵工程系翻译室。现有英语（国家一流专业建设点）、日语、语言学（校友会中国大学语言学专业排名（研究型）前3强）三个本科专业，外国语言文学一级学科硕士点以及翻译硕士（MTI）专业学位点，硕士招生专业有英语语言文学（050201）、俄语语言文学（050202）、日语语言文学（050205）、外国语言学及应用语言学（050211）、英语笔译（055101），学生培养均在</span><span><strong><span>南京校区</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>学院建有“语言信息智能处理及应用”工信部重点实验室、国家民委“一带一路”国别与区域研究中心（白俄罗斯研究中心）、长三角语料库与数据驱动教学研究协同创新、日本研究中心、 “一带一路”语言文化传播战略研究中心等研究平台，外国语言文学获批“十四五”江苏省重点学科。近年来，学院教师在国际重要检索SCI、SSCI、A&amp;HCI、CSSCI期刊等发表论文百余篇；出版专著近40部（其中外文专著8部），每年出版中文专著2-3部；共获批国家级和省部级课题40多项；获江苏省哲社成果二等奖2项，三等奖2项。</span></p><p><span>学院现有教职工97人，其中教授7人，副教授22人，博士生导师1人、硕士生导师22人，具有博士学位教师36人，具有海外博士学位教师18人，另外每年聘请十余名外国专家或外籍教师来学院任教。学院现有江苏省教学名师、江苏省“青蓝工程”中青年学术带头人、“333高层次人才培养工程”第三层次培养对象、江苏省“双创博士”、江苏省社科优青等省部级高水平人才10人。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>校园开放日活动</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>基本信息</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJRiaibeac7jUqlnWoUPBIkNt3taNOG21OskWdAsezsicMxsG0aEAtAOU0zk5qLqGtP9Yu1dOQElhkh0A/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动形式</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2025年7月7日-7月14日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国本科院校四年制三年级在校生（2026年应届毕业生），本科专业为外国语言文学及相关专业；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人对外国语言文学相关专业研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息，由学院进行资格审核，7月16日在外国语学院网站公示参加开放日的人员名单，不另行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>申请人需在7月14日之前将下列材料发送至邮箱youying25_sfsnjust@126.com，邮件主题命名格式为：“姓名-本科院校-报考专业-联系方式”。</span></p><p><span>（1）校园开放日活动申请表（研究生院报名系统中导出，要求信息填写完备，并由所在单位签章）；</span></p><p><span>（2）近期正面免冠彩色证件照片，电子版JPG格式，150×200像素，大小500K以内；</span></p><p><span>（3）本科阶段历年成绩单（须加盖教务处或院系公章），JPG或PDF格式；</span></p><p><span>（4）有关获奖证书和学术科研成果，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作；</span></p><p><span>（5）其他相关的附件材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本次校园开放日日程为7月21日。活动内容包括学院及专业情况介绍、招生相关政策讲解、语言信息智能处理及应用工信部重点实验室云参观、导师研究前沿报告及师生互动交流等。具体安排如下：</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRiaibeac7jUqlnWoUPBIkNt3HQvfCzVjXSVW0aMT5ZiaJhouwRrcVb7WaVnux8FsdtlWrnxia3xSZZ6g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）校园开放日活动不收取任何费用。</span></p><p><span>（2）登录开放日平台后，要求全程参加活动。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）联系人： </span></p><p><span>蔡老师（手机17356630957）</span></p><p><span>韩老师（手机13915982879）</span></p><p><span>（2）电子邮箱：youying25_sfsnjust@126.com</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRiaibeac7jUqlnWoUPBIkNt3pz4mt11ONdsTLedyPm286gFOuwg6UtDordPmDiaA59LWEibSSc31DMDg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>出品 | 南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源 | 外国语学院</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 代芳冰</span></p><p><span>初审 | 秦俊华  </span><span>外国语</span><span>学院</span></p><p><span>审核 | 齐玉辉</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"cb490a5551f49efff77e10e6f0a8e0e51f40750c02fa14f497eef24d917b3cbd","textLength":1445,"sourceSha256":"7042287d5731ec9d40833d8e2c63ab78fd6685051076434f434390f24718b1fe","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ed38f95313c2480113e2","title":"2025年南京理工大学外国语学院2025年校园开放日活动公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:47.154775+00:00"}
